### Nine billing: walk through the whole surface.
### In IntelliJ, click the green arrow next to each request. Run them top to bottom.

@host = http://localhost:18081
@tenant = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 1. Report usage: 120 agent-seconds. Expect 201, chargedMinor 240 (2.40 GBP).
POST {{host}}/v1/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-001",
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "metric": "agent_seconds",
  "quantity": 120
}

### 2. Same event again. Expect 200, replayed: true, SAME transactionId, no second charge.
POST {{host}}/v1/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-001",
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "metric": "agent_seconds",
  "quantity": 120
}

### 3. Another metric. 3 seats at 9.00 GBP. Expect 201, chargedMinor 2700.
POST {{host}}/v1/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-002",
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "metric": "seats",
  "quantity": 3
}

### 4. Balance. Expect owedMinor 2940, display "29.40 GBP".
GET {{host}}/v1/tenants/{{tenant}}/balance

### 5. Ledger lines, newest first. Two transactions, four postings.
GET {{host}}/v1/tenants/{{tenant}}/ledger?limit=20

### 6. Unknown metric. Expect 422 application/problem+json, balance unchanged.
POST {{host}}/v1/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-003",
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "metric": "moon_landings",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. Bad request: blank eventId, quantity 0. Expect 400 naming both fields.
POST {{host}}/v1/usage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "",
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "metric": "seats",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 8. Reverse a transaction. Paste a transactionId from step 5 below. Expect 201.
### Then rerun step 4: balance drops by that amount. Rerun step 5: lines grew, nothing deleted.
POST {{host}}/v1/ledger/PASTE-TRANSACTION-ID-HERE/reverse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "idempotencyKey": "rev-001",
  "reason": "goodwill credit"
}

### 9. Reverse the same transaction again. Expect 409: a transaction is reversed once.
POST {{host}}/v1/ledger/PASTE-TRANSACTION-ID-HERE/reverse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "{{tenant}}",
  "idempotencyKey": "rev-002",
  "reason": "again"
}

### 10. Health.
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
